Completed the independent seven-stage audit.

Verdict: **CONCERNS / LEGIT**. The proof is sound, non-vacuous, and pins the real program. Concerns are limited to the supplied opaque `sortVS` contract and partial MPY-to-CPython bridge.

- [Detailed REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)
- [Reviewer evidence and scripts](/audit-output/evidence/)
